# Subtasks are a fork of the format
[ ] Ship the release
	[x] Write the notes
	[x] Tag the commit
	[ ] Publish
[x] Tidy the office
	[x] Move the plants
	[x] Find whose mug that is

# One tab per level, to any depth
[ ] Any depth works
	[ ] One tab
		[ ] Two tabs
			[ ] Three

# A subtask keeps its own due date
[ ] Parent -> 2026-12-31
	[ ] Child has its own -> 2026-08-14
	[ ] So does this one -> 2026-09-01

# Descriptions continue with four spaces, or a tab
[ ] This one has a description ...
	... continued with a tab
	[ ] and a subtask under that
		... which continues too

# Spaces do not nest, and the Problems panel says so
[ ] This parent keeps its own level
  [ ] two spaces is reported as cannot-nest
    [ ] four spaces is description text, not a subtask
